# Collapse checked-in generated files in GitHub PR diffs.

# Dependency resolver outputs.
Cargo.lock linguist-generated
apps/desktop/package-lock.json linguist-generated
apps/ui/package-lock.json linguist-generated
apps/reef/package-lock.json linguist-generated
tools/openapi-forge/package-lock.json linguist-generated

# Protobuf TypeScript bindings generated by buf/protoc-gen-es.
apps/ui/src/generated/** linguist-generated

# Documentation pages and navigation refreshed by `make docs-generate`.
apps/docs/docs.json linguist-generated
apps/docs/project/changelog.mdx linguist-generated
apps/docs/reference/bundled-sources.mdx linguist-generated
apps/docs/reference/community-sources.mdx linguist-generated

# JSON schemas generated by `make schema-generate`.
crates/coral-spec/src/schema/identity_manifest.schema.json linguist-generated
crates/coral-spec/src/schema/source_manifest_v4.schema.json linguist-generated

# Upstream inputs pinned by `make slack-spec-fetch`. Fetched, never authored:
# manifest.json records a digest per file and the build verifies it on read,
# so a hand edit here fails rather than surviving. Corrections belong in
# tools/openapi-forge/apis/slack/overlay.yaml.
tools/openapi-forge/apis/slack/snapshot/** linguist-generated

# Slack descriptor and its catalog preview, regenerated by `make slack-spec`.
# Neither is hand-edited: the descriptor comes from the pinned snapshot and the
# preview from `xtask v4-preview`. The preview is the reviewable half — it
# shows the tables, columns and pagination the descriptor produces.
sources/v4/slack/openapi.yaml linguist-generated
sources/v4/slack/catalog-preview.md linguist-generated
